  "body": "Many thanks @agriggio for looking at my bug report #510 and making an adjustment to ART for this.  \n\nUnfortunately, the problem is still present in ART 1.26.8.  If I do exactly the same as in bug #510 , ie download the RAW and arp files from https://drive.proton.me/urls/EDB0KYK6NC#nGVKBOuT3qGL open the RAW in ART, apply the arp profile, then zoom into 100% - still ART gets to 10% through the noise reduction, freezes for 20sec then crashes.  \n\nPlease would you mind most awfully having another look at this problem, to see if there is a way to prevent it happening?\n\nAnd if there is any further information I can supply that would be helpful, please let me know.",
